WEBVTT

00:00:00.573 --> 00:00:01.214
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.196 --> 00:00:04.177
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m going away for the weekend.

00:00:08.119 --> 00:00:09.191
<v><b>B:</b></v> So am I.

00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:11.478
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.746 --> 00:00:14.980
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t like spicy food.

00:00:18.961 --> 00:00:20.143
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither do I.

00:00:21.963 --> 00:00:22.710
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:23.934 --> 00:00:25.815
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’d love to visit China.

00:00:29.824 --> 00:00:30.968
<v><b>B:</b></v> So would I.

00:00:32.787 --> 00:00:33.430
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:37.035
<v><b>A:</b></v> I went to the beach last weekend.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.018
<v><b>B:</b></v> So did I.

00:00:43.888 --> 00:00:44.671
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:45.871 --> 00:00:47.515
<v><b>A:</b></v> I haven’t had dinner yet.

00:00:51.558 --> 00:00:52.840
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither have I.

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:55.357
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:56.612 --> 00:00:58.385
<v><b>A:</b></v> I can’t play the guitar.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.623
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither can I.

00:01:05.409 --> 00:01:06.122
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:07.409 --> 00:01:09.609
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’m going to buy a new car.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:14.663
<v><b>B:</b></v> So am I.

00:01:16.506 --> 00:01:17.107
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:18.309 --> 00:01:20.782
<v><b>A:</b></v> I didn’t watch TV last night.

00:01:24.756 --> 00:01:26.009
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither did I.

00:01:27.607 --> 00:01:28.293
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 9

00:01:29.728 --> 00:01:31.936
<v><b>A:</b></v> I’ve been to London three times.

00:01:35.893 --> 00:01:37.144
<v><b>B:</b></v> So have I.

00:01:38.879 --> 00:01:39.548
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 10

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.444
<v><b>A:</b></v> I don’t usually go to bed very early.

00:01:47.316 --> 00:01:48.585
<v><b>B:</b></v> Neither do I.